SUMMARY:Want to Take Your Spiritual Life to the Next Level?
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you want to l
 earn more about Eckankar\, the path of Spiritual Freedom?**\n\n**Are you l
 ooking for a step-by-step path to spiritual transformation?**\n\n**Do you 
 want to discover a deeper understanding of who you truly are**\n**as Soul\
 , a divine spark?**\n\n**Is your family seeking ways to bring spirituality
  into the home**\n**that's beyond religion?**\n\nIf you are wondering how 
 this path can take your spiritual life to the next level\, join in to lear
 n more about what it means to become an ECK student.\n\nWe will discuss be
 nefits\, what is involved\, the cost\, how it might fit into your busy lif
 e\, and so much more!\n\nCome with your questions and curiosity as we expl
 ore the ways Eckankar can open your heart to your own personal\, unique co
 nnection with the Divine.\n\nIf you are curious about the teachings of Eck
 ankar\, brand new to the teachings or have been a student of Eckankar for 
 a year or less\, this class is for you!\n\n“**The ECK Spiritual Living C
 ourses** are a living road map to spiritual transformation. Not only revea
 ling the path to your goal\, but providing **high adventure every step of 
 the way**. Each month brings you a new measure of enlightenment.”\n*─*
 Harold Klemp\, *Spiritual Living Courses*\, FAQ page on Eckankar website\n
 [https://www.eckankar.org/engage/advanced-spiritual-living/study-faqs/](ht
 tps://www.eckankar.org/engage/advanced-spiritual-living/study-faqs/)
