SUMMARY:The Power of Gratitude
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you want more
  love and peace\, and less stress and worry?**\n\nRecognizing and apprecia
 ting the blessings in our lives helps us see life's gifts and opens our he
 arts to greater Divine love.\n\n"Abundance flourishes in a grateful heart\
 ; Gratitude is the secret of love."\n— Harold Klemp\, T*he Spiritual Law
  of Life\,* p. 167\n\n**Come join an enlightening spiritual discussion to 
 share what you are grateful for and learn a spiritual exercise to open you
 r heart to more love and gratitude.**
