SUMMARY:You are Soul. You are Free—A Sound of Soul Event
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you feel you 
 are more than your physical self?**\n\n**Would you like to experience your
 self as a divine being\, as Soul\, eternal and creative?**\n\n**Are you in
 terested in spiritual tools to receive guidance and get answers?**\n\n**Do
  you want to experience your life as a spiritual adventure?**\n\n“Soul? 
 What is Soul? You *are* Soul!\n“Soul is a divine part of God. All that r
 emains is for you to recognize yourself. And to recognize yourself as a di
 vine part of God\, you must first—and more than anything else—recogniz
 e every living thing also as this part of God. We are in this Ocean of Lov
 e and Mercy.\n“If there is nothing else than love in life\, there is mor
 e than enough for all. So take this love that dwells in you and give it to
  the world.”\n—Harold Klemp\, *The Sound of Soul*\, p. 8\n\nYou are wa
 rmly welcome to experience a 15–20-minute contemplation using an ancient
  and very powerful mantra followed by an interactive discussion with other
 s of like heart.\n\n**Discover this sacred sound\, HU\, that anyone of any
  faith or background can use!**\n\nHU can:\n• Bring inner peace\, and a 
 higher perspective on your life\n• Help you get answers and receive guid
 ance\n• Help you rise above human limitations and experience your own di
 vinity\n\nHU can uplift people of any religion\, culture\, or walk of life
  when practiced with an open heart.\n\n**Family and friends are always wel
 come!**\n\nLearn more about how to develop a powerful spiritual exercise t
 hat can transform your daily life **[HERE](https://eckankarblog.org/hu-app
 /)**\nTo hear thousands of people singing HU and to sing along\, download 
 the free HU app **[HERE](https://www.eckankar.org/experience/hu-the-sound-
 of-soul/)**
