SUMMARY:Embracing this Spiritual Adventure—A Spiritual Chat for 18-40 yo
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Have the challen
 ges you have overcome made you stronger spiritually?**\n\n**Would you like
  to release fear to have a more vibrant\, enjoyable life?**\n\n**Are you s
 eeking spiritual freedom in your life?**\n\n“Do everything\, large or sm
 all\, as if you were doing it for God alone. That means the task will be d
 one with love\, joy\, and (don't forget) thoroughness.”\n—Harold Klemp
 \, *Youth Ask a Modern Prophet about Life\, Love\, and God*\, p. 63\n\nYou
 ’re warmly invited to this casual and upbeat chat with other young spiri
 tual seekers who want to learn more about the ways of the Divine. Come and
  share your stories or listen to others' stories of how Spirit works uniqu
 ely with each of us.\n\n***Explore*** . . .\n\n* How responding to life wi
 th conﬁdence can become a habit\n* Spiritual techniques to help you welc
 ome divine blessings\n* Chanting the ancient mantra\, HU\, to open doorway
 s for your spiritual growth\n* Learn about a Spiritual Exercise that can h
 elp you see the stepping stones to your highest self.\n\nDrop in when it w
 orks for you and cameras are always optional.\nLooking forward to meeting 
 you!\n\n**Welcome to Eckankar**\nThe teachings of ECKANKAR are based on Go
 d’s love and spiritual freedom for everyone.\n\nThey offer you individua
 l spiritual tools\, whatever your path or religion may be\, to bring you m
 ore understanding\, love\, and help in these challenging times.\n\nCome\, 
 stay as long as you like\, and explore spiritual resources that can help y
 ou\, at your own pace. Feel free to come and to go as you wish.\nThere is 
 no pressure\, expectation\, judgment\, or unasked-for follow up.\n**We res
 pect your divinity as a spiritual being.**\n\n**We honor your choices and 
 your journey.**
