SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**You’re invited
  to the ECKANKAR Center of Santa Rosa’s Open House**\n**where you can:**
 \n\n* Check out what the Eckankar Center of Santa Rosa has to offer.\n* En
 joy a complimentary slice of **sweet and/or savory pie** catered from *Cri
 minal Bakery* in Santa Rosa. (Gluten free available)\n* Select a refreshme
 nt from our Beverage Bar featuring Peet's Coffee.\n* Watch light-hearted t
 alks and inspiring musical performances live-streamed from the CA-NV ECK L
 ight and Sound service titled:\n***The Quest for God Consciousness.***\n* 
 Do a fun hands-on and contemplative spiritual activity inspired from the\n
 ***Raise Your Spiritual IQ! Experience Jounal.***\n**Featured Spiritual Ac
 tivity** **— Treasure Within**\n* If you wish\, A complimentary copy of 
 the guidebook will be yours to take home.\n\n**You can also:**\n\n* **Newl
 y Available**: Register to become an Eckankar Student and receive ***The E
 asy Way Discourse Package*** on site at the Eckankar Center of Santa Rosa.
  (limited supply available)\n* Pick out a Free Introductory ECK Book from 
 a wide range of spiritual topics.\n* Borrow and Eckankar Book from our Len
 ding Library.\n* Sign up to receive our free e-newsletter that features lo
 cal events and classes.\n* Fill out a spiritual activity request form wher
 e you can request in-person specialty workshops such as Dreams and Past Li
 ves Recall.\n* Share community with like-hearted Souls.\n\n**Open House Ac
 tivity Timeline - 10:45 am to 2:00 pm**\n10:45 am - 11:00 am\n\n* Meet and
  Greet Time\n* Beverage Bar Open\n\n11:00 am – 12:00 pm\n\n* Live Stream
  of the California and Nevada ECK Light and Sound Service\n\n12:00 pm to 2
 :00 pm\n\n* Pie Bar Open\n* Treasure Within Creativity Station Activity Av
 ailable
