SUMMARY:The Quest for God Consciousness—ECK Light and Sound Service
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n“The Quest for G
 od Consciousness: that’s a path and a quest that is the search for truth
 \, for enlightenment\, to be all that one can really be as was intended wh
 en each individual as Soul was born from the heart of the Divine Reality. 
 . . .\n"This aim\, this purpose\, is what ECKANKAR is all about\, this que
 st for God consciousness."\n—Sri Doug Kunin\, Video talk\, *The Quest fo
 r God Consciousness*\n\n**Are you searching for truth and meaning in your 
 life?**\n\nDiscover important spiritual keys on how to recognize truth and
  deepen awareness of your divine purpose.\nExperience the power of chantin
 g HU\, a sacred and ancient mantra\, and how it connects us with the God C
 urrent\, which comes equally to us all.\n\n**We are pleased to let you kno
 w that we will have ASL interpretation\, live closed captioning\, and simu
 ltaneous Spanish translation.**\n\nThis is a family-friendly event\, celeb
 rating our true nature as Soul at any age.\nThis special free Zoom event i
 s open to everyone—invite your family and friends!\nYou are welcome to j
 oin the session any time after 10:30 a.m. to enjoy the prelude music until
  the program begins. Upon joining the webinar\, attendees will be in view-
 only mode.
